WEBVTT

00:00.400 --> 00:05.073
Everyone gets their own login, so every entry is tied to one person.

00:05.223 --> 00:07.785
Tap Invite Member, then pick a role.

00:07.935 --> 00:12.971
Each role sees only what it needs. Caregivers get incidents and documents.

00:13.121 --> 00:17.005
Read Only is for an inspector, a consultant, or family.

00:17.655 --> 00:20.352
Now try it: tap + Invite Member.
